codex
The first browser run exposed two test-harness issues: an existing heading assertion was non-exact and matched the empty-state heading, and Radix’s checkbox is a button so Playwright’s `.check()` did not validate its state. I corrected the spec to use an exact heading and click/assert `aria-checked`; the implementation itself passed the other 9 item tests.
